# `results/qc/` — Quality-control outputs

Generated, ignored machine-readable review artifacts: per-unit metrics, cohort
summaries, exclusion lists, diagnostic records, and validation markers. Every
data-derived graphic, including a QC plot, belongs in `results/figures/`; do not
split graphics between the two homes. Never hand-edit these files; fix the stage
or scientific configuration and rebuild.

See the root [`README.md`](../../README.md) contract and
[`../AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md).
